# Bare-name core dumps land at the workspace root; keep that pattern
# anchored so source directories named core/ (e.g.
# apps/morpheus/src/core/) stay tracked.  PID-suffixed dumps may appear
# in any tool build directory, so keep core.* unanchored.
/core
core.*
